  "scope": "Bring your own OMP: the documented client is the unmodified upstream Oh My Pi v18.3.0 release binary for Windows x64, Linux x64 and macOS arm64, and both lanes move to the stock-client runtime - RTX 5090 container to 86733c0e and RTX 4090 native Windows to b0e8c2fa, which differs only by a Windows-only commit margin before pinned host allocations. The runtime diff passed a four-model council and four remediation epochs. Model, serving settings and memory floors are unchanged from v0.7.4. RTX 3090 is omitted pending physical-host access. Every runtime gate below was measured on the published components; nothing is carried from v0.7.4.",
