  "interpretation": "An unmodified upstream OMP client now keeps durable sessions on both lanes: on the published RTX 5090 image and the installed RTX 4090 package, stock OMP 18.3.0 with only the documented fragments recalled its session across graceful restarts, including a new OMP process whose first request named no previous response and was restored from the session's checkpoint. New sessions start from the shared prefix: on the published image no measured fresh agent session fell back to a full prefill. The RTX 5090 durability workload, publication barrier and probe set match v0.7.4's results, and the RTX 4090 package passed its 15 canonical phases with the OMP 18.3.0 tool call, including its first managed start after a fresh install, where the beta.2 candidate without the commit margin was refused (alphastorm/omp-ninfer#48 stays open until field confirmation). Automatic checkpoints stay best effort and universal warm reuse is not claimed.",
